<ul>
<li><strong>6 × 20 yards</strong> with sled at 15% bodyweight</li>
<li>Full rest between reps — 90 seconds minimum, 2 minutes ideal</li>
<li>2 sessions per week with at least 48 hours between</li>
<li>Follow each sled session with 4 × 20-yard sprints at full speed, no sled — this teaches your nervous system to translate the resisted strength into free-sprint speed</li>
</ul>
